---
permalink: /changelog/
pageKey: changelog
title: "What's New in Mailkin: Release Notes"
description: "Release notes for Mailkin, the Mail translator for Mac: every version and what changed."
crumbs: [{ name: "What's new" }]
---
<article class="doc">
  <h1>What's new in Mailkin</h1>
  <p class="answer">Mailkin {{ site.version }} is the current version, released {{ site.versionDate | localDate("en") }}. The version downloaded from mailkin.app updates itself; the App Store version is updated by the App Store. Subscribe with the <a href="/feed.xml">RSS feed</a>.</p>
  {%- for r in releases %}
  <section id="v{{ r.version }}">
    <h2>Mailkin {{ r.version }}</h2>
    <p class="updated"><time datetime="{{ r.date | isoDate }}">{{ r.date | localDate("en") }}</time></p>
    {{ r.notes | safe }}
  </section>
  {%- endfor %}
</article>
